  "notes": "Refers to foretelling future events, whether through supernatural means (prophecy) or rational analysis (prediction). The word carries more weight than a simple guess.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {予言|よげん}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{当|あ}たる→当たる：01860_ataru⟧: a prediction comes true\n- {予言|よげん}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{外|はず}れる→外れる：02395_hazureru⟧: a prediction proves wrong\n- {予言|よげん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{信|しん}じる→信じる：01111_shinjiru⟧: to believe a prophecy\n- {予言|よげん}⟦どおり→どおり：09884_doori⟧: as predicted/prophesied\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{予測|よそく}→予測：03665_yosoku⟧: forecast — more scientific and data-driven\n- ⟦{予想|よそう}→予想：03664_yosou⟧: expectation — more informal, everyday guessing\n- {預言|よげん}: divine prophecy — specifically religious revelation (same pronunciation, different kanji)",
